  "description": "FsCheck.NUnit integrates FsCheck with NUnit by adding a PropertyAttribute that runs FsCheck tests, similar to NUnit TestAttribute.\n\n            All the options normally available in vanilla FsCheck via configuration can be controlled via the PropertyAttribute.",
